WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.224 --> 00:00:16.755
A few days later, the king and queen left the castle.

2
00:00:18.097 --> 00:00:20.919
They were going to visit a king in a faraway land.

3
00:00:23.581 --> 00:00:26.844
Nana and the prince waved good-bye from the castle steps.

4
00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:32.784
"Nana, take care of my precious boy," the queen said.

5
00:00:32.804 --> 00:00:36.286
"Bring me presents!"

6
00:00:36.766 --> 00:00:39.087
the prince shouted as the carriage rolled away.

7
00:00:42.628 --> 00:00:43.529
Nana sighed.

8
00:00:44.769 --> 00:00:47.531
This was her chance to try a magic spell.

9
00:00:48.671 --> 00:00:50.232
But magic was serious.

10
00:00:51.272 --> 00:00:53.653
Fairies used it only when they had to.

11
00:00:55.314 --> 00:00:58.535
She decided to talk to the prince one last time.

12
00:00:58.555 --> 00:01:02.649
"Prince, one day you'll rule this kingdom.

13
00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:06.051
You must have a kind and generous heart.

14
00:01:07.111 --> 00:01:09.293
Please show me that you can be kind."

15
00:01:09.313 --> 00:01:14.075
"Okay." The prince looked around.

16
00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:18.918
"I see some servant girls.

17
00:01:19.778 --> 00:01:21.519
I'll ask if they need anything."

18
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:24.901
He ran to the servants.

19
00:01:24.921 --> 00:01:27.482
"You're working so hard.

20
00:01:28.563 --> 00:01:30.324
Can I bring you a refreshment?"

21
00:01:31.744 --> 00:01:33.885
The servant girls looked surprised.

22
00:01:33.905 --> 00:01:39.826
"Why, um, certainly, Your Highness," one said.

23
00:01:39.846 --> 00:01:43.007
"Great! I'll get some fruit."

24
00:01:43.807 --> 00:01:45.628
The prince dashed into the castle.

25
00:01:48.569 --> 00:01:50.289
He returned with a bowl of fruit.

26
00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:53.450
Nana beamed.

27
00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.170
"He's learning!"

28
00:01:55.671 --> 00:01:56.251
she thought.

29
00:01:56.271 --> 00:02:00.372
"Maybe magic isn't needed after all!"

30
00:02:02.508 --> 00:02:05.969
But then the prince laughed and threw the fruit at them.

31
00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.391
that!" Nana pulled the prince away.

32
00:02:13.411 --> 00:02:16.792
"I've tried to teach you to be kind.

33
00:02:17.832 --> 00:02:20.533
But your heart is as cold as stone.

34
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:24.034
So, I must do what I must do."

35
00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:26.975
The prince laughed.

36
00:02:29.555 --> 00:02:30.416
"Like what?"

37
00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.181
"Like this!"

38
00:02:35.882 --> 00:02:41.887
Poof! The prince turned into a statue of stone covered in gold.

39
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:49.594
will stand frozen above the village, watching your people.

40
00:02:51.495 --> 00:02:54.758
Seeing their struggles will surely soften your heart."

41
00:02:54.778 --> 00:02:59.902
"Break this spell now!"

42
00:03:00.403 --> 00:03:01.644
the statue cried.

43
00:03:03.748 --> 00:03:06.210
"Only you can do that," Nana said.

44
00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.913
"Tell me when you know how to be kind."

45
00:03:13.996 --> 00:03:14.916
Days passed.

46
00:03:18.139 --> 00:03:21.101
Nana waited, nervously watching the statue.

47
00:03:21.121 --> 00:03:26.845
"Surely the prince sees the people's troubles now," she thought.

48
00:03:26.865 --> 00:03:30.288
"And surely he wants to help them."

49
00:03:32.856 --> 00:03:34.997
But the statue stayed silent.

50
00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:40.000
Then one day news came.

51
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:42.862
The king and queen were returning home.

52
00:03:44.743 --> 00:03:46.263
Nana ran to the statue.

53
00:03:46.284 --> 00:03:51.326
"I can't let them see my magic spell," she thought.

54
00:03:53.247 --> 00:03:54.948
She tried to break the spell herself.

55
00:03:56.609 --> 00:04:00.671
But nothing worked—the magic was too strong.

56
00:04:03.572 --> 00:04:05.755
Nana buried her face in her hands.

57
00:04:05.775 --> 00:04:09.661
"The king will throw me into the dungeon!

58
00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.285
I must leave at once!"

59
00:04:13.707 --> 00:04:19.695
Poof! Nana disappeared, leaving the statue all alone.
